OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds of budgerigars compete in
OL,4,Achampionship
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of budgerigars and their
OL,7,Fowners have gathered in Surrey for a
OL,8,Fchampionship show celebrating a hobby
OL,9,Fthat enthusiasts say has been passed
OL,10,Fdown through generations.
OL,12,FA total of 468 birds have been entered
OL,13,Finto the Gold Open Championship Show in
OL,14,FSmallfield, near Horley, organiser
OL,15,FWayne Greening said.
OL,17,FCompetitors are taking part in a range
OL,18,Fof classes, with birds judged on their
OL,19,Fquality and condition as they compete
OL,20,Ffor rosettes and prize money.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
